  - name: Building
    description: '

      Philosophy: Building that follows a spline path with similar
      structure to ComplexBuilding

      - Spline length determines building extent
      along the path

      - Width creates perpendicular structure depth

      -
      Floors stack vertically with windows/doors

      - Roof tiles over the top
      following spline curvature'
